> Is there a way to make my pet Archon drop his Demonbane and wield my Vorpal
> Blade? He will sometimes pick it up, but never wield it.

Giving pets artifacts depends on two features that pets have:

1) When a pet steps on an artifact it picks up that artifact and
will wield compatible artifacts no matter what it currently wields.
A pet wielding a super artifact can be given a junk artifact to
switch to.  Eventually the pet will drop the super artifact because
it's no longer wielded.

2) Artifact compatibility matters.  Lawful pets want to wield
lawful artifacts and won't wield chaotic ones and so forth.
Archons have an alignment of 15 which is very lawfull.

So pick a junk lawful artifact (none exist, all of the lawful
ones are excellent) or an unaligned one (any of Dragonbane,
Ogresmasher, Trollsbane, Werebane might be viewed as junk
or at least worse than Demonbane).


